# NestJS backend

**Language:** Write all backend code, comments, and related commit messages in **English**.

Applies to `src/` (NestJS + TypeORM). Frontend consumes endpoints at **`/uiapi/`** — path enums live in `ui/src/enums/api.enum.ts`.

## Official documentation

When unsure, check [NestJS docs](https://docs.nestjs.com/) and [TypeORM docs](https://typeorm.io/) before guessing.

## Layer boundaries

| Layer              | Path                   | Role                                  |
| ------------------ | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| **UI API**         | `src/ui-api/{domain}/` | HTTP controllers + DTOs for frontend  |
| **Domain**         | `src/domain/{domain}/` | Business logic, orchestration         |
| **Database**       | `src/db/`              | Entities, repositories, migrations    |
| **Global**         | `src/global/enum/`     | Shared enums                          |
| **Infrastructure** | `src/infrastructure/`  | Guards, pipes, validators, decorators |

**Controllers stay thin** — validate input, call domain service, return response. No business logic or direct complex queries in controllers.

## UI API module layout

```
src/ui-api/{domain}/
  {domain}.controller.ts
  {domain}.ui-api.module.ts
  dto/
    {domain}.dto.ts
```

Register new modules in `src/ui-api/ui-api.module.ts`.

Reference: `src/ui-api/customer/` (`customer.controller.ts`, `customer.ui-api.module.ts`).

## Controller conventions

```ts
@UseGuards(CognitoAuthGuard)
@Controller('/uiapi/customer')
export default class CustomerController {
  constructor(private readonly customerService: CustomerService) {}

  @Post('search')
  public async search(
    @Body() params: FilterParams,
    @Session() { user }: SessionData,
  ): Promise<SearchResponse<Customer>> {
    return this.customerService.search(params, user);
  }
}
```

- **`@Controller('/uiapi/{resource}')`** — prefix must match frontend `ApiBaseUrl`
- **`@UseGuards(CognitoAuthGuard)`** on protected routes (match neighbouring controllers)
- **`@Session() { user }: SessionData`** for authenticated user context
- **Search endpoints:** usually `@Post('search')` or `@Post('/search')` returning `SearchResponse<T>`
- **Validation:** `CustomValidationPipe` with `ValidationGroup.*` for create/update; `ValidationPipe` for simpler bodies
- **Logging:** `Logger` on controller; log errors with `getErrorDataToLog` where file already uses it
- **Default export** for controller and module classes (project norm)

## Domain module layout

```
src/domain/{domain}/
  {domain}.service.ts
  {domain}.domain.module.ts
```

```ts
@Module({
  imports: [
    /* other domain modules, ConfigModule */
  ],
  providers: [CustomerService, CustomerRepository],
  exports: [CustomerService],
})
export default class CustomerDomainModule {}
```

- Domain service: **`@Injectable()`**, `export default class XxxService`
- Import domain module in matching **`{domain}.ui-api.module.ts`**
- Repositories from `@db/repo/`; entities from `@db/entities/`

## DTOs

- Live in `src/ui-api/{domain}/dto/`
- Use **`class-validator`** + **`class-transformer`** (`@Expose`, `@Transform`, `@ValidateNested`)
- Validation groups: **`ValidationGroup`** from `@db/enum` — separate create/update/draft rules
- Custom validators: `@infrastructure/validation` (`CustomDataValidator`, `DictionaryFieldValidator`, …)
- Shared field DTOs: `@infrastructure/dto` (e.g. `AddressDTO`, `FieldValueDTO`)

## Path aliases (backend)

| Alias               | Path                   |
| ------------------- | ---------------------- |
| `@domain/*`         | `src/domain/*`         |
| `@uiapi/*`          | `src/ui-api/*`         |
| `@db/*`             | `src/db/*`             |
| `@global/*`         | `src/global/*`         |
| `@infrastructure/*` | `src/infrastructure/*` |

## Grids & search

See **`.cursor/rules/data-grid.mdc`** for DataGrid metadata and list views.

- Grid metadata: `src/domain/grid/metadata/`
- Search/filter payloads: `FilterParams` from `@domain/grid/interfaces`
- Domain services often use `GridService` for list/search endpoints

## Migrations & entities

- Entities: `src/db/entities/`
- Migrations: `src/db/migrations/` — do not edit entities without considering migration impact
- Enums: prefer `@db/enum` or `@global/enum` over string literals

## Before finishing

- [ ] Controller under `/uiapi/...` — thin, delegates to domain service
- [ ] DTO validation with appropriate `ValidationGroup` / pipes
- [ ] Domain logic in `src/domain/`, not in controller
- [ ] UI API module registered in `ui-api.module.ts`
- [ ] New frontend paths added to `ui/src/enums/api.enum.ts` when exposing new endpoints
- [ ] Auth guard applied consistently with neighbouring endpoints
